    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A BLAST FROM THE PAST!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marvelous marble runs, with a modern twist. Rollick N' Roll combines fun physics with intuitive controls to deliver a joyful puzzle experience for all ages. Expand your collection by unlocking fun vehicles and playsets, but be prepared for things to get a bit chaotic.\u00a0<br><br>Sometimes you just have to laugh!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Intuitive controls</strong> -\u00a0Press the button. See what happens.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Easy, medium or hard</strong> -\u00a0More vehicles means more mayhem.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Need more?</strong>\u00a0- Try some formidable time trials!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa7 Chill tunes\u00a0</strong>- Professionally composed soundtrack by <i>Rest!\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udccb No training necessary</strong> - We hate tutorials too.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc75 For ages 5 to 105</strong> -<strong>\u00a0</strong>Seriously, granny will love this.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274880/extras/15a1a90dab601852ec3606d28ce2c0f5.poster.avif?t=1749764942\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274880/extras/15a1a90dab601852ec3606d28ce2c0f5.webm?t=1749764942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A BLAST FROM THE PAST!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marvelous marble runs, with a modern twist. Rollick N' Roll combines fun physics with intuitive controls to deliver a joyful puzzle experience for all ages. Expand your collection by unlocking fun vehicles and playsets, but be prepared for things to get a bit chaotic.\u00a0<br><br>Sometimes you just have to laugh!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Intuitive controls</strong> -\u00a0Press the button. See what happens.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Easy, medium or hard</strong> -\u00a0More vehicles means more mayhem.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Need more?</strong>\u00a0- Try some formidable time trials!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa7 Chill tunes\u00a0</strong>- Professionally composed soundtrack by <i>Rest!\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udccb No training necessary</strong> - We hate tutorials too.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc75 For ages 5 to 105</strong> -<strong>\u00a0</strong>Seriously, granny will love this.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274880/extras/15a1a90dab601852ec3606d28ce2c0f5.poster.avif?t=1749764942\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274880/extras/15a1a90dab601852ec3606d28ce2c0f5.webm?t=1749764942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
